{"id":"647225","name":"南瓜泥发糕","author":"putimama","authorId":"8334261","desc":"","cover":"images/647225/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"300g"}],"sub":[{"name":"南瓜泥","amount":"适量"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"3g"},{"name":"泡打粉","amount":"2g"},{"name":"水","amount":"适量"},{"name":"青丝碎","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"南瓜洗净，去皮切片。","img":"images/647225/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将南瓜片蒸熟。","img":"images/647225/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"将南瓜片压泥并过细筛，加入酵母粉搅拌均匀。","img":"images/647225/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"再加入白糖。","img":"images/647225/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"搅拌至糖化。","img":"images/647225/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒入南瓜泥，再加入适量水搅拌成糊状盖盖饧发。","img":"images/647225/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"饧发后再搅拌均匀。","img":"images/647225/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"模具中底部及周围铺油纸，放入青丝碎、再倒入搅拌好的糊饧至10分钟，盖盖水开后蒸25分钟。","img":"images/647225/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"南瓜泥发糕成品出锅。","img":"images/647225/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"切开看看，柔软膨松。","img":"images/647225/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}